<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-07T08:59:25.907Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 08:59:25 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces continue a month-long siege of Taiz while Yemeni government troops have seized the strategic al-Jawf mountain range, intensifying front-line fighting. The Saudi-led coalition intercepted a Houthi cruise missile and a long-range anti-tank guided missile over Riyadh, and downed a Houthi ballistic missile aimed at Medina. A market strike in southwestern Yemen killed at least 20 civilians, and a missile attack on an oil tanker in the Gulf killed a sailor. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/05/yemen-president-sacks-ministers-and-officers-houthis&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168730&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxQX2dnUGl1aW80ME5NMmhGWnZqLThHcjYwem9KMnVOUVlqQmM4XzNiemlVOWhMTGJ1MFNqNGZacmlMNnNab3dicnNnREtRLVA5bjdONV9yV1pEVXlPTW5jaGpBNDNCS3NVeFUxYUQzdWt6SHgyVE9aZnl3ZlZEN0I4RQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;OCHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxQb2RjbDhBZFlqa1VmQmI2OVdxcG1iQ0x2S0o4dmphS1BYdUVwSU1QSEpwZi02cHVuQWxhVlBMZE9ya3dZVHdQN2pKZzljVklOQlh6MzVCNmdUUTktQU1XRjNiSmFjd3k1LU42dnZJQWhheFdHV3hxNU8wMGtUa1Z4VURGQkcwYnctdVB2WC1kQk1Pd2lXNjFsX2xRTS16bl9zdXlCdEdsU3d1LWdIQ18xQ1Zzd2tkazFMakdLYWRVdEwtZGFo?oc=5&quot;&gt;Saudi Gazette&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPbHotZTFWcVBBTHd4LWtzLVVhM19OY2NxVjZqaUs3bHYtM3Ffc01sckZQNk43TXBwamF3dkFmM21vZlpWdDB4VHVVVlRyVFlfb2ZyU0ZDQlBncU5yZGI1cnJUSHNWdXV2QWtWd1dZY2JwYzUweE1kLWd6a2RGX2MtRU9LUGdsUE1XRGczeDExY0c3Y1JHT2oxd0w5NjVhUnZl